# Local runtime artifacts: a fetched llama.cpp build and downloaded models.
# Gigabytes, machine-specific, and re-fetched by the scripts under scripts/.
# No trailing slash on purpose: a local run may leave a symlink here, and `dir/`
# only matches a directory.
/runtime
/models
